# "You control enchanted creature" is a control-changing static ability (CR 613.1b, layer 2) that applies for as long as
# Mind Control is attached to the creature (CR 611.3a). Bot1's Mind Control takes Bot2's Llanowar Elves: Bot1 has not
# controlled it continuously since their turn began, so it can't attack and its {T} ability can't be activated (CR 302.6); Bot1's
# Ornithopter is offered in the same declaration. Bot2 destroys the Aura on their turn with Disenchant: the effect ends and the Elves is Bot2's again (Bot2's battlefield),
# but it came under Bot2's control this turn, so it is summoning sick for Bot2 too and its mana ability is refused (CR
# 302.6). The positive control is the same activation on Bot2's next turn, which adds {G}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Mind Control
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Plains
Disenchant
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mind Control.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.SummoningSick = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mind Control.AttachedTo = Llanowar Elves
! Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
! Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mind Control)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.SummoningSick = true
! Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
? Bot2.Mana = {G}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Ornithopter; Island; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Mind Control
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Plains; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
Bot2.Graveyard = Disenchant
